    2.10: apply_fact @2.8,2.9
    2.11: cut "(∀e. 0 < e ⟶ (∃N. ∀n. ∀x. n ≥ N ∧ -w < x ∧ x < w ⟶ abs (sum (s ∩ {0..n}) (λi. of_nat i * a i * x ^ (i - 1)) - real_infsum s (λi. of_nat i * a i * x ^ (i - 1))) ≤ e))"
    2.11: introduction e
